    "Cookie and authorization headers are redacted by default. URLs, console messages and screenshot content are not redacted. Nothing is uploaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cookie and authorization headers are redacted by default. URLs, console messages and screenshot content are not redacted. Nothing is uploaded."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "כותרות Cookie ו‑Authorization מוסתרות כברירת מחדל. כתובות URL, הודעות מסוף ותוכן צילום המסך אינם מוסתרים. שום מידע אינו מועלה."
